Model artifact attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package contains NO model weights. It loads the released Hibiki artifact
bundle at runtime from a local directory or from the Hugging Face Hub.

The Hibiki model artifacts are published by Kyutai:

    kyutai/hibiki-1b-mlx-bf16
    revision b3d6291f3dcf7954e1a502e4d66f32e3556f17ae
    https://huggingface.co/kyutai/hibiki-1b-mlx-bf16

Those artifacts -- the configuration, the Hibiki language-model weights, the
Mimi codec weights, and the SentencePiece tokenizer -- are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC-BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Redistributing the artifacts, or outputs presented as derived from them, must
retain that attribution. The Apache 2.0 license of this package does not apply
to the model artifacts, and the CC-BY 4.0 license of the artifacts does not
apply to this package's source code.

Hibiki is described in "High-Fidelity Simultaneous Speech-To-Speech
Translation" (Labiausse et al., arXiv:2502.03382).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Independence from upstream runtimes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package is an independent MLX reimplementation. It does not depend on,
vendor, or invoke `moshi_mlx`, `rustymimi`, or `moshi-swift`. Those projects are
used only as read-only behavioral references at pinned revisions when producing
parity evidence outside the distributed package.
